  "description": "Reports what only a running process can see — runtime version, environment name, and the package versions actually loaded — to a William Belle LLC monitoring endpoint. Read-only and one-way: it exposes no endpoint, accepts no commands, collects no logs or user data, and cannot fail the host application. Requires an application id and signing key issued by William Belle LLC.",
